# Kindled Heroism targets any creature: on turn 3 Bot1 gives Bot2's Ornithopter +1/+0 and first strike, and the scry may
# leave the card looked at on top (CR 701.22a): Black Lotus stays on top of Bot1's library, above Mox Sapphire. Lightning Bolt
# was drawn on turn 3. Turn 2: the Ornithopter is still a 0/2 flier.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Kindled Heroism
Mountain x5
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kindled Heroism.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Black Lotus | )
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying

[Expect]
Bot1.Library = Black Lotus; Mox Sapphire
